Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:47:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: translate migration buttons before inserting their
 counts

Use stable translatable button labels with a separate formatted count line. The old concatenated labels fell back to English for every count. Preserve migration behavior and require all four messages in every catalog.
